  <entry>
    <title>0818二分图</title>
    <link href="/0818%E4%BA%8C%E5%88%86%E5%9B%BE/"/>
    <url>/0818%E4%BA%8C%E5%88%86%E5%9B%BE/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="1关于双射限制的处理-trick"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#1关于双射限制的处理-trick"></a> 1.关于双射限制的处理 （trick）</h2><p>对于一个双射的限制，你如果单考虑一边到另一边的限制的转化可能会导致限制过窄，这个时候你可以去考虑两个限制一起转化，这样可以保证限制转化后已等价的</p><p><a href="https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P8299">example</a></p><p>这题可以这样考虑；对于一个 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">opt=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.80952em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">o</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span> 的限制，实际上可以把它转化成$\forall i \in [l,r] $ ，其取值范围 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>←</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_i \leftarrow S_i\cap [1,x]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.83333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.05764em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.31166399999999994em;"><span style="top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-left:-0.05764em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">←</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.83333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.05764em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.31166399999999994em;"><span style="top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-left:-0.05764em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∩</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.16666666666666666em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span> ， <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">opt=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.80952em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">o</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span> 时同理。这样第一眼好像是对的，但是题目要求的是区间最大值等于<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span> ，而不是小于 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span> ，故而这个转化是于原限制不等价的。但是这个转化有很好的性质，我们希望保留它，所以我们考虑对填的数 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span> 也做一个限制，进一步收窄范围，使得转化后的限制于原限制等价。于是我们考虑对一个 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">opt=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.80952em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">o</span><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span> 的限制，<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span> 在数组中的出现位置范围 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>←</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>∩</mo><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_v \leftarrow P_v \cap[l,r]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.83333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.151392em;"><span style="top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-left:-0.13889em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span><span class="mrel">←</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2777777777777778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.83333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.13889em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.151392em;"><span style="top:-2.5500000000000003em;margin-left:-0.13889em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right:0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∩</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.2222222222222222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.01968em;">l</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.16666666666666666em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right:0.02778em;">r</span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span>。这样我们就成功对原限制做了一个完全等价的转化，直接跑二分图就是可以的了。</p><h2 id="2处理二分图的细节问题-warning"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#2处理二分图的细节问题-warning"></a> 2.处理二分图的细节问题 (warning)</h2><p>在把一个问题转化成一个二分图之后，计算最大匹配等东西的时候一定要注意只能往一个集合中加新点，不然会出现大问题！！</p><p><a href="https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P10939">problem</a></p><p>警钟长鸣！！在代码中，我错误地将行列下标和的奇偶性当作了映射的奇偶性，这导致我计算的时候往二分图的两个点集中加点，使得答案错误。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  <entry>
    <title>small_moon&#39;s tricks</title>
    <link href="/small-moon-s-tricks/"/>
    <url>/small-moon-s-tricks/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="差分"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#差分"></a> 差分</h2><ul><li>在一些对相邻元素进行较复杂、会互相影响的操作时，可以思考使用差分（思维来源：相邻的修改 <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.36687em;vertical-align:0em;"></span><span class="mrel">⇒</span></span></span></span> 差分），例题<a href="https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/2252/D">CF2252D</a></li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  
